 * @desc Maximum function. For use only in the Formula property of control types that support formulas
 * @example MAX(${Table1/LineItemTotal*}) 
 *  //Maximum of ALL <i>LineItemTotal</i> field/control values in the table
 * @example MAX(${Table1}, FOR_EACH {#{unitPrice} * #{quantity}}) 
 *  //Maximum of product of ALL <i>unitPrice</i> and <i>quantity</i> data elements 
