/**
 * @function COUNT
 * @memberof formulas
 * @param {com.ibm.bpm.coach.CoachView} view
 * @param {function} forEachIterator (Optional) Use with FOR_EACH function
 * @desc Count function. For use only in the Formula property of control types that support formulas
 * @example COUNT(${Table1/LineItemTotal*}) 
